M. DAS ALPHA Jean | Dossier RCS 1990A15101 · dépôt 2026D000001 du 02/11/2026 | Dossier RCS | Validee | [0,1,2,3,5]
Demande D1515100123 | demande D1515100123 · interrompu | Dossier RCS | AFaire | []
DAS NI BETA SAS | Non-inscrit NI15111 · refusé | Non-inscrit | Rejetee | [0]
M. DAS ALPHA Jean | Dossier RCS 1990A15101 · dépôt 1990D15141 du 01/03/1990 | Dossier RCS | Validee | [0,1,2,3,5]
Demande 2601100320 | demande 2601100320 | Dossier RCS | EnCours | [0]
controle: SELECT p.DPTRC_CATEGORIE_DEPOT + '|' + a.NumeroArrivee + '|' + CONVERT(varchar(10), a.IdNonInscrit) + '|' + CONVERT(varchar(10), d.DMND_ID_AUTRE) + '|' + d.DMND_NUM_INDICATIF FROM v2.DEPOT_RCS AS p JOIN rec.ActionRegistre AS a ON a.IdDepot = p.DPTRC_ID_DPTRC JOIN v2.DEMANDE AS d ON d.DMND_ID_ACTRC = a.Id WHERE p.DPTRC_NUM_DEPOT = '2026000001' AND d.DMND_CODE_PROSS = 'DAS' => A|2026000002|1510111|1510111|NI15111
